      "id": "claim_f70609e3527446c8941ce545ece8f536",
      "statement": "`modules/reports` has no `data/` layer: the folder holds only `domain/` and `ui/`, so the report route fetches through `modules/batches/data` and the module has no report-scoped snapshot type of its own.",
