      "id": "claim_f02e326645554010a61b62dde0366998",
      "statement": "The learner roster is fetched only on the report route because it carries contact, address and employment data in `learner_details`, whose read policy names admin, coordinator and viewer and omits trainer — so RLS returns no `learner_details` row to a trainer and every detail cell maps to the empty string.",
      "evidence": [
