    {
      "id": "claim_08cd811314014281ba0f556d692aba70",
      "statement": "Both roster queries return `sync-failed` on any error, so no error-code predicate remains in the source: the `42703` / `PGRST200` / `PGRST204` tolerance is historical, and a schema regression fails the snapshot visibly rather than blanking qualification cells.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://modules/batches/data/learners.ts#L232-L292",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a8fd67fcb639162292892754bbd04df35120058f23618b6d3451bf35a172b7f9:"
