      "statement": "EGACE rates are computed over `outcomeEnrolledBase` — enrolled summed across only the batches that record outcomes — while `computeEgaceTotals` sums enrolled across every batch, so batches without outcome data cannot dilute a rate; `ReportView` builds the rate argument by spreading totals with the narrowed enrolled base.",
