    {
      "id": "claim_eca0a7c2e7b0472584dbf77e90a156b5",
      "statement": "`buildXlsx` is a zero-dependency zip-store archive of five minimal OOXML parts returning a Blob typed as a spreadsheet, written with inline strings, an escaped and 28-character-truncated sheet name, and row 1 as the header; it was moved out of the view into `domain/` so it is unit-testable (rule 35) and part of the module's public surface (rule 8).",
