      "id": "claim_78c9e4491ab140c3852ec80e9ead2d99",
      "statement": "`report-xlsx.test.ts` pins the writer's failure modes: the IEEE CRC-32 check vector, the local zipped-header and end-of-central-directory magic, all five part paths, header row 1 and data from row 2, XML-escaped cell values, spreadsheet column letters past Z, and sheet-name truncation — leaving compression, styles, shared strings and multi-sheet books unpinned.",
